menu "USB Audio (subsys/usb_audio)"

    config USB_AUDIO_FEED_PERIOD_US
        int "Feeder period (us)"
        default 1000
        range 250 4000
        help
            How often the feeder task moves bytes from the ring into TinyUSB's
            software FIFO while streaming. 1000 us matches the USB frame. Shorter
            lowers latency at the cost of wakeups; longer relies on the FIFO
            (CONFIG_TINYUSB_AUDIO_EP_IN_SW_BUF_MULT) to bridge the gap.

    config USB_AUDIO_FEED_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "Feeder task priority"
        default 19
        range 1 24
        help
            Between audio capture (20) and the USB device task (18): the feeder must
            run as soon as capture publishes, but never delay capture itself.

    config USB_AUDIO_FEED_TASK_CORE
        int "Feeder task core affinity"
        default 1
        range 0 1
        help
            Same core as capture and USB so the whole audio path is isolated from
            the radio stacks on core 0 (ADR-009).

    config USB_AUDIO_FEED_TASK_STACK
        int "Feeder task stack (bytes)"
        default 3072
        range 2048 8192

endmenu
